This program i wrote is named Hardware identifier. 

ASM--> C ---> PERL the languages i used to create this


This is so far soley runs on LINUX machines but if ur windows have perl 
you could execute it by running perl analyze.pl using system administrative privilages. 
On linux to run - sudo ./analyze.pl 

This will give you all your hardware id and names vendors manufactures. 

